        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Italian_Village"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Several sections of Italian Village were recently added to the National Register of Historic Places, highlighting its architectural heritage.",
